# Sample storefront isolation

`maxfreedom.screenmerch.com` is the sample store (`isDemoStorefront()` in `frontend/src/utils/demoStorefront.js`). Real creator hosts such as `filialsons.screenmerch.com` must not inherit sample-only cart, checkout, or Tools shortcuts.

Gate sample-only behavior with `isDemoStorefront()`. Do not use hostname checks that match every `*.screenmerch.com` storefront.

Sample-only:

- Tab-scoped cart (sessionStorage only; closing the tab clears it)
- Checkout “These items are not for sale” and no real charges
- Browse/cart without shopper sign-in
- Apply Edits returns to browse with cart open, not checkout
- Tools auto-selects the newest cart item and resets Product Preview
- Tools can run from a pending screenshot with no cart item

Real storefronts keep a persistent cart, real checkout, and Tools focus on the cart item being edited.
